From: MakOS Project <makos@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] widget: add MakOS surface and graphics-info backend

Recognize cairo-makos as a distinct Gecko widget toolkit. Add AArch64 native
surface ABI plus MakOS GfxInfo XPCOM service. Report actual virtio-gpu and
MakOSSurface software-compositor properties; never alias Linux/macOS or claim
host graphics APIs.

diff --git a/toolkit/moz.configure b/toolkit/moz.configure
index 7eb76b2dd0..b8bfb7a288 100644
--- a/toolkit/moz.configure
+++ b/toolkit/moz.configure
@@ -556,6 +556,8 @@ def toolkit_choices(target):
         return ("cairo-uikit",)
     elif target.os == "Android":
         return ("cairo-android",)
+    elif target.os == "MakOS":
+        return ("cairo-makos",)
     else:
         # cairo-gtk3 - X11 backend with optional Wayland backend (auto detected)
         # cairo-gtk3-wayland - Wayland backend with optional X11 backend (auto detected)
